  "headline": "Yuji Itadori symbolism: motifs and how they connect to the series themes",
  "description": "Motifs around Yuji Itadori and how they map onto Jujutsu Kaisen’s themes.",
  "articleBody": "Yuji Itadori is a forward-driving force in Jujutsu Kaisen. The point of analysis is not trivia, but repeated choices under pressure.\n\nThis piece stays evergreen: it focuses on patterns in depiction rather than time-sensitive plot claims.\n\n1. Motifs: list repeated signs (tools, clothing, habits, language).\n\n2. Inversions: find moments where a repeated sign flips meaning.\n\n3. Theme mapping: connect the character’s stance to the series’ protected values.",
